 changed lines and their callers, the four l\neft items the tasks.md block \"Verifier follow-ups, coordinator\" names, or a pass-one or pass-two finding whose fix holds. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input that shows i\nt. A finding without a concrete input is not a finding. HARD RULE: never open, read, print or diff .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/holdout-prompts.jsonl, and neve\nr read rows of command-prompts.jsonl whose split is holdout. One commit deleted one line of that sealed file: check it only with `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff --numstat ec1869dae8..HEAD -- <that p\nath>`, which must print 0 added and 1 deleted. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder. Run tests as `env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run <file>` from .skilled/skills\n/system-skill-advisor/runtime, or `node --test <file>` for .cjs tests, single files only. Do not run a build, the full suite, a daemon or a model CLI.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"fold -w 200 /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/c9fe91ef-9b85-4bdc-88fb-4d6f766eaecf/scratchpad/review-instructions-3.txt | sed -n '1,80p'\"}"},"time":{"start":1794593425393,"end":1794593426702}}}}
