{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794593587575,"sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0baffeXQQt48JD3haI5K","part":{"partID":"prt_1d61cac81001z5tJahcM20aDxI","sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0baffeXQQt48JD3haI5K","messageID":"msg_1d61c9759001CXs3LxS9QNS4wR","type":"tool","id":"call_fd2c7ae0477b4275b2a321c2","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent review state for the advisor-runtime-3 fan-out lineage. Narrow pass three: review only the changed lines of the files whose area in `review-scope-3.txt` is `advisor-runtime`, plus their callers, and report only defects with a concrete input.\n\n### Review Charter\n\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder), narrow changed-lines pass over the two remediation commits `ec1869dae8..1ca14a44`.\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability, one focus per iteration.\n- Stop conditions: convergence (weighted new-finding ratio under 0.10 after the second iteration) or `maxIterations=4`.\n- Success criteria: every changed line and its callers read; every finding carries `file:line` and a concrete failing input; holdout hygiene proved by a numstat-only check of the sealed file.\n- Write surface: this lineage directory only. No code changes, no repo tooling that writes outside it.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nCommand surfacing, review pass three, advisor-runtime area: the shared no-edit gate (`command-attach.ts`, `scorer/text.ts`, `scorer/fusion.ts`), the subprocess busy scan, the routing-accuracy runners (`command-offer.mjs`, `worktree-restore.mjs`, `run-command-behaviour.mjs`, `score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs`), `measure-brief-cost.mjs`, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, the OpenCode plugin and the tests the remediation commits changed.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Re-reporting a pass-one or pass-two finding whose fix holds.\n- Re-reporting the four items listed under `Verifier follow-ups, coordinator` in `017-review-pass-two-remediation/tasks.md`.\n- Duplicating the `doctor-docs` area files (another lineage owns them).\n- Reading holdout prompt text. Only counts and a numstat line are permitted.\n- Changing code, running builds, the full suite, a daemon or a model CLI.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` under 0.10 at iteration 3 or later with all dimensions covered.\n- `maxIterations=4` reached.\n- A hard gate failure in the append gateway (exit 2) or a containment breach. Both halt the lineage.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n- [Approach]: [Why it worked] (iteration N)\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n- [Approach]: [Why it failed] (iteration N)\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus area: the shared no-edit gate in `lib/command-attach.ts` and its three consumers (`lib/scorer/text.ts`, `lib/scorer/fusion.ts`), plus the subprocess busy scan in `lib/subprocess.ts`\n- Why: these changed lines are the widest-reach edits in the area; a wrong result here changes every command offer.\n- Required evidence: `git diff ec1869dae8..HEAD` per file, direct reads of the current code, caller reads, and one concrete prompt input per finding.\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: the 27 `advisor-runtime` files listed in `review-scope-3.txt`; base commit `ec1869dae8`, HEAD `1ca14a44988d3812ef18d968aba304ed31481648`.\n- Behavior claims: `017-review-pass-two-remediation/tasks.md` task lines T003, T004, T005, T010 to T015, T029, T034 to T035, T042 to T045; each fix's verify states its expected output.\n- Reuse and conventions: `command-attach.ts` keeps no import so the scorer can import it without a cycle; the shared `isNoEditRequest` is the single pattern source; NUL porcelain keeps paths unquoted; a run log is untrusted input.\n- Review risks and gaps: `steer.md` is absent at init, so no lead ruling was available; the coverage-graph seed step was skipped because `upsert.cjs` writes under the spec folder, outside this lineage's write surface, and iteration `graphEvents` carry the graph instead; `resource_map.md` is absent so its coverage gate is skipped.\n- Holdout hygiene: `holdout-prompts.jsonl` was checked only by `git diff --numstat`, which printed `0 1`. No row text opened.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Task lines and changed code compared during iterations. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Task verify clauses compared with the code. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Plugin and agent surfaces in the area. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the advisor-runtime area. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | Catalog files belong to the doctor-docs area. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | Playbook files belong to the doctor-docs area. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| .opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js | - | - | - | pending |\n| .opencode/plugins/tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/subprocess.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-brief-cost.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/worktree-restore.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/derive-command-bridges-strings.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/measure-brief-cost.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/read-only-explainer.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/subprocess-output-cap.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/worktree-restore.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 4\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-advisor-runtime-3-1794593402980-zhrui5, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-13T18:12:09Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent review state for the advisor-runtime-3 fan-out lineage. Narrow pass three: review only the changed lines of the files whose area in `review-scope-3.txt` is `advisor-runtime`, plus their callers, and report only defects with a concrete input.\\n\\n### Review Charter\\n\\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder), narrow changed-lines pass over the two remediation commits `ec1869dae8..1ca14a44`.\\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability, one focus per iteration.\\n- Stop conditions: convergence (weighted new-finding ratio under 0.10 after the second iteration) or `maxIterations=4`.\\n- Success criteria: every changed line and its callers read; every finding carries `file:line` and a concrete failing input; holdout hygiene proved by a numstat-only check of the sealed file.\\n- Write surface: this lineage directory only. No code changes, no repo tooling that writes outside it.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nCommand surfacing, review pass three, advisor-runtime area: the shared no-edit gate (`command-attach.ts`, `scorer/text.ts`, `scorer/fusion.ts`), the subprocess busy scan, the routing-accuracy runners (`command-offer.mjs`, `worktree-restore.mjs`, `run-command-behaviour.mjs`, `score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs`), `measure-brief-cost.mjs`, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, the OpenCode plugin and the tests the remediation commits changed.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Re-reporting a pass-one or pass-two finding whose fix holds.\\n- Re-reporting the four items listed under `Verifier follow-ups, coordinator` in `017-review-pass-two-remediation/tasks.md`.\\n- Duplicating the `doctor-docs` area files (another lineage owns them).\\n- Reading holdout prompt text. Only counts and a numstat line are permitted.\\n- Changing code, running builds, the full suite, a daemon or a model CLI.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` under 0.10 at iteration 3 or later with all dimensions covered.\\n- `maxIterations=4` reached.\\n- A hard gate failure in the append gateway (exit 2) or a containment breach. Both halt the lineage.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n- [Approach]: [Why it worked] (iteration N)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n- [Approach]: [Why it failed] (iteration N)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[Populated when a review approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n[Review angles that were investigated and definitively eliminated -- consolidated from iteration dead-end data]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: correctness\\n- Focus area: the shared no-edit gate in `lib/command-attach.ts` and its three consumers (`lib/scorer/text.ts`, `lib/scorer/fusion.ts`), plus the subprocess busy scan in `lib/subprocess.ts`\\n- Why: these changed lines are the widest-reach edits in the area; a wrong result here changes every command offer.\\n- Required evidence: `git diff ec1869dae8..HEAD` per file, direct reads of the current code, caller reads, and one concrete prompt input per finding.\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: the 27 `advisor-runtime` files listed in `review-scope-3.txt`; base commit `ec1869dae8`, HEAD `1ca14a44988d3812ef18d968aba304ed31481648`.\\n- Behavior claims: `017-review-pass-two-remediation/tasks.md` task lines T003, T004, T005, T010 to T015, T029, T034 to T035, T042 to T045; each fix's verify states its expected output.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `command-attach.ts` keeps no import so the scorer can import it without a cycle; the shared `isNoEditRequest` is the single pattern source; NUL porcelain keeps paths unquoted; a run log is untrusted input.\\n- Review risks and gaps: `steer.md` is absent at init, so no lead ruling was available; the coverage-graph seed step was skipped because `upsert.cjs` writes under the spec folder, outside this lineage's write surface, and iteration `graphEvents` carry the graph instead; `resource_map.md` is absent so its coverage gate is skipped.\\n- Holdout hygiene: `holdout-prompts.jsonl` was checked only by `git diff --numstat`, which printed `0 1`. No row text opened.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Task lines and changed code compared during iterations. |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Task verify clauses compared with the code. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Plugin and agent surfaces in the area. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent file in the advisor-runtime area. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | - | Catalog files belong to the doctor-docs area. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | Playbook files belong to the doctor-docs area. |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| .opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .opencode/plugins/tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/subprocess.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/measure-brief-cost.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/worktree-restore.mjs | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/derive-command-bridges-strings.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/measure-brief-cost.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/read-only-explainer.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/subprocess-output-cap.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/worktree-restore.vitest.ts | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 4\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-advisor-runtime-3-1794593402980-zhrui5, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-13T18:12:09Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794593565825,"end":1794593587575}}}}
