{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794594391910,"sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0baffeXQQt48JD3haI5K","part":{"partID":"prt_1d6292a94001Me0V36ql7juil5","sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0baffeXQQt48JD3haI5K","messageID":"msg_1d6290bca001hfM4LT6Vlg6xHg","type":"tool","id":"call_7867a919694144029e283586","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3 && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport re\np='deep-review-strategy.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"- [x] correctness\\n- [x] security\\n\",\"- [x] correctness\\n- [x] security\\n- [x] traceability\\n- [x] maintainability\\n\")\ns=s.replace(\"- Dimension: traceability and maintainability\\n\",\"\")\n# what worked / failed\ns=s.replace(\"- Checking the only two code-executing calls in a backfill against one trust gate: it anchored the security pass to concrete spawn sites rather than to prose (iteration 3).\",\n\"- Checking the only two code-executing calls in a backfill against one trust gate: it anchored the security pass to concrete spawn sites rather than to prose (iteration 3).\\n- Mapping every task line to its changed files in one table, then running the plugin and handler suites: it closed traceability and maintainability without a new read of the whole area (iteration 4).\")\ns=s.replace(\"- Trusting the task's three named scope-limiting cases as proof the class is fixed: the probe found a fourth wording the cases do not cover (iteration 1).\",\n\"- Trusting the task's three named scope-limiting cases as proof the class is fixed: the probe found a fourth wording the cases do not cover (iteration 1).\\n- Treating the catalog pages that name `metadata.compiledRouteSummary` as in scope: the task block marks them as one of the four left items, so they were not reported (iteration 4).\")\nrows={\n\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\":\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\",\n\".opencode/plugins/tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs\":\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\",\n\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts\":\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\",\n\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts\":\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\",\n\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts\":\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\",\n}\nfor path,val in rows.items():\n    pat=re.compile(r\"\\| \"+re.escape(path)+r\" \\| [^|]+ \\|\")\n    assert pat.search(s), path\n    s=pat.sub(f\"| {path} | {val} |\", s, count=1)\n# cross-reference statuses\ns=s.replace(\"| `spec_code` | core | partial | 1 | T003-T005 consumers match; T042 intent only partly met (AR3-P2-001). |\",\"| `spec_code` | core | pass | 4 | Every changed file maps to a task line; T042 intent partly met (AR3-P2-001). |\")\ns=s.replace(\"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 1 | Three targeted suites: 56 passed, 0 failed. |\",\"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 4 | Six suites (114 tests), plugin suite (43 tests) and the handler/hook suites (36 tests) passed; no failed tests. |\")\ns=s.replace(\"| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Plugin and agent surfaces in the area. |\",\"| `skill_agent` | overlay | pass | 4 | Plugin field tests T027/T028/T045 assert command, policy and owner. |\")\n# next focus\nm=re.search(r\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n(.*?)\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\", s, re.S)\nnew=\"\"\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: none remaining\n- Focus area: synthesis\n- Reason: all four dimensions have at least one pass and every changed line in the area was read with its callers.\n- Rotation status: complete; stop reason is the iteration ceiling.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: AR3-P2-001 remains open as an advisory.\n- Required evidence: registry counts, four iteration verdicts, synthesis report.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\"\"\"\nif m: s=s[:m.start()]+new+s[m.end():]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPY"},"output":"ok\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ok\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3 && python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport re\\np='deep-review-strategy.md'\\ns=open(p).read()\\ns=s.replace(\\\"- [x] correctness\\\\n- [x] security\\\\n\\\",\\\"- [x] correctness\\\\n- [x] security\\\\n- [x] traceability\\\\n- [x] maintainability\\\\n\\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\\"- Dimension: traceability and maintainability\\\\n\\\",\\\"\\\")\\n# what worked / failed\\ns=s.replace(\\\"- Checking the only two code-executing calls in a backfill against one trust gate: it anchored the security pass to concrete spawn sites rather than to prose (iteration 3).\\\",\\n\\\"- Checking the only two code-executing calls in a backfill against one trust gate: it anchored the security pass to concrete spawn sites rather than to prose (iteration 3).\\\\n- Mapping every task line to its changed files in one table, then running the plugin and handler suites: it closed traceability and maintainability without a new read of the whole area (iteration 4).\\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\\"- Trusting the task's three named scope-limiting cases as proof the class is fixed: the probe found a fourth wording the cases do not cover (iteration 1).\\\",\\n\\\"- Trusting the task's three named scope-limiting cases as proof the class is fixed: the probe found a fourth wording the cases do not cover (iteration 1).\\\\n- Treating the catalog pages that name `metadata.compiledRouteSummary` as in scope: the task block marks them as one of the four left items, so they were not reported (iteration 4).\\\")\\nrows={\\n\\\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\\\":\\\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\\\",\\n\\\".opencode/plugins/tests/system-skill-advisor.test.cjs\\\":\\\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\\\",\\n\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts\\\":\\\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\\\",\\n\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/hooks/skill-advisor-cli-fallback-envelope.vitest.ts\\\":\\\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\\\",\\n\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts\\\":\\\"D3, D4 | 4 | 0 | complete\\\",\\n}\\nfor path,val in rows.items():\\n    pat=re.compile(r\\\"\\\\| \\\"+re.escape(path)+r\\\" \\\\| [^|]+ \\\\|\\\")\\n    assert pat.search(s), path\\n    s=pat.sub(f\\\"| {path} | {val} |\\\", s, count=1)\\n# cross-reference statuses\\ns=s.replace(\\\"| `spec_code` | core | partial | 1 | T003-T005 consumers match; T042 intent only partly met (AR3-P2-001). |\\\",\\\"| `spec_code` | core | pass | 4 | Every changed file maps to a task line; T042 intent partly met (AR3-P2-001). |\\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\\"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 1 | Three targeted suites: 56 passed, 0 failed. |\\\",\\\"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 4 | Six suites (114 tests), plugin suite (43 tests) and the handler/hook suites (36 tests) passed; no failed tests. |\\\")\\ns=s.replace(\\\"| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Plugin and agent surfaces in the area. |\\\",\\\"| `skill_agent` | overlay | pass | 4 | Plugin field tests T027/T028/T045 assert command, policy and owner. |\\\")\\n# next focus\\nm=re.search(r\\\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\\\n(.*?)\\\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\\", s, re.S)\\nnew=\\\"\\\"\\\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- Dimension: none remaining\\n- Focus area: synthesis\\n- Reason: all four dimensions have at least one pass and every changed line in the area was read with its callers.\\n- Rotation status: complete; stop reason is the iteration ceiling.\\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: AR3-P2-001 remains open as an advisory.\\n- Required evidence: registry counts, four iteration verdicts, synthesis report.\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nif m: s=s[:m.start()]+new+s[m.end():]\\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\\nprint('ok')\\nPY\"}"},"time":{"start":1794594384532,"end":1794594391910}}}}
