{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794594567190,"sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0baffeXQQt48JD3haI5K","part":{"partID":"prt_1d62bdc08001oRwomd53nBlcZB","sessionID":"ses_e29e5c0baffeXQQt48JD3haI5K","messageID":"msg_1d62bbdca001APKYbSFmCMXmLg","type":"tool","id":"call_7291824aee314034b2f6094f","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Lineage Deviations and Boundary Records\n\nRecorded by the executor for the `advisor-runtime-3` fan-out lineage.\n\n- `steer.md` did not exist at init, before any iteration, or at the final read. No lead ruling was available; the dispatch prompt and the reviewed files governed.\n- Phase save was not run. The dispatch forbids `generate-context.js`, and the lineage has no packet continuity target outside its own folder. Continuity for this lineage is its state log, strategy, report and registry.\n- The coverage-graph seed step was skipped. `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/upsert.cjs` writes under the spec folder, which is outside this lineage's write surface. The iteration records carry `graphEvents` (valid node kinds and edge relations) so the reducer still receives the graph.\n- `resource_map.md` is absent and `resource_map.emit` is false in this lineage config, so the Resource Map Coverage Gate is skipped.\n- `validate.sh` was not run: the dispatch forbids it, and the lineage's completion evidence is its artifacts plus the append-gateway receipts.\n- `AC_COVERAGE` is reported as `disabled` in the synthesis report because the validation signal was not evaluated; no acceptance-coverage claim is made.\n- The loop reached the config ceiling of 4 iterations. Iteration 4 covers traceability and maintainability together because those were the last two dimensions; the terminal record carries `stopReason: maxIterationsReached`.\n- Root-level review files (`review/deep-review-findings-registry.json`, `review/orchestration-summary.json`, `review/fanout-attribution.md`, `review/observability-events.jsonl`, `review/review-report.md`) were not written by this lineage. Their timestamps predate this run or their producer is `fanout-run` in `observability-events.jsonl`; this lineage wrote only under `review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/`.\n- The sealed holdout file was checked only with `git diff --numstat`, which printed `0 1`. No row text was opened, printed or diffed.\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/logs/deviations.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/logs/deviations.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/logs/deviations.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Lineage Deviations and Boundary Records\\n\\nRecorded by the executor for the `advisor-runtime-3` fan-out lineage.\\n\\n- `steer.md` did not exist at init, before any iteration, or at the final read. No lead ruling was available; the dispatch prompt and the reviewed files governed.\\n- Phase save was not run. The dispatch forbids `generate-context.js`, and the lineage has no packet continuity target outside its own folder. Continuity for this lineage is its state log, strategy, report and registry.\\n- The coverage-graph seed step was skipped. `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/upsert.cjs` writes under the spec folder, which is outside this lineage's write surface. The iteration records carry `graphEvents` (valid node kinds and edge relations) so the reducer still receives the graph.\\n- `resource_map.md` is absent and `resource_map.emit` is false in this lineage config, so the Resource Map Coverage Gate is skipped.\\n- `validate.sh` was not run: the dispatch forbids it, and the lineage's completion evidence is its artifacts plus the append-gateway receipts.\\n- `AC_COVERAGE` is reported as `disabled` in the synthesis report because the validation signal was not evaluated; no acceptance-coverage claim is made.\\n- The loop reached the config ceiling of 4 iterations. Iteration 4 covers traceability and maintainability together because those were the last two dimensions; the terminal record carries `stopReason: maxIterationsReached`.\\n- Root-level review files (`review/deep-review-findings-registry.json`, `review/orchestration-summary.json`, `review/fanout-attribution.md`, `review/observability-events.jsonl`, `review/review-report.md`) were not written by this lineage. Their timestamps predate this run or their producer is `fanout-run` in `observability-events.jsonl`; this lineage wrote only under `review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/`.\\n- The sealed holdout file was checked only with `git diff --numstat`, which printed `0 1`. No row text was opened, printed or diffed.\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/advisor-runtime-3/logs/deviations.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794594561032,"end":1794594567190}}}}
